    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MMWard Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 7 Ornamental Gardens, a luxurious first-floor, two-bedroom duplex apartment located within one of Naas` most sought-after residential developments.\n\nFinished to a high standard and maintained in great condition throughout, this impressive property boasts spacious, bright and light-filled interiors extending to approximately 98 sq. m. (1,055 sq. ft.).\n\n With its own private entrance and generously proportioned accommodation, this fine home will appeal to a wide range of purchasers, including first-time buyers, downsizers seeking to move from a larger home, and investors alike.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with guest WC, a spacious kitchen/dining area and a generous living room. Upstairs, there are two large double bedrooms, both benefiting from en-suite bathrooms.\n\nConstructed circa 2007, the property benefits from gas-fired central heating, double-glazed windows, communal gardens, a designated car parking space and ample visitor parking.\n\nIdeally situated within walking distance of schools, shops, Naas GAA and a host of local amenities, Ornamental Gardens enjoys an excellent location close to Naas Town Centre. \nA bus service is conveniently located directly outside the development, while the property also benefits from excellent transport links, with the M7/N7 motorway easily accessible and Sallins Train Station just a short drive away.\n\nViewing of this spacious and ideally located home comes highly recommended.\n\nManagement Fee: Approximately 2,050 per annum"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 12'8\" (3.86m) x 9'4\" (2.84m)\nWooden flooring\n\nGuest WC\nTiled flooring, part tiled walls, WC, WHB and extractor fan.\n\nLiving Room - 13'3\" (4.04m) x 17'3\" (5.26m)\nFinished with attractive wooden flooring, A large window overlooking the green area, and elegant ceiling coving, Creating a bright and welcoming living space.\n\nKitchen/Dining area - 9'9\" (2.97m) x 7'7\" (2.31m)\nOpen plan from the living room, featuring tiled flooring and part tiled walls. \nThe fully fitted kitchen includes an integrated fridge freezer, oven, hob, extractor fan and dishwasher. \nThe dining area provides a bright and practical space for everyday living and entertaining.\n\nLanding\nAccess to attic, Hot press\n\nBedroom 2 - 12'9\" (3.89m) x 11'4\" (3.45m)\nWith built-in wardrobe and generous floor space.\n A bright and comfortable double bedroom.\n\n\nEn suite - 9'1\" (2.77m) x 5'7\" (1.7m)\nFully tiled throughout and fitted with a bath with shower mixer, WC and wash hand basin.\n\nMaster bedroom - 17'3\" (5.26m) x 12'1\" (3.68m)\nSpacious double bedroom featuring carpet flooring, Built-in wardrobes and a separate walk-in wardrobe, Providing excellent storage space.\n\nEn Suite - 7'4\" (2.24m) x 8'2\" (2.49m)\nFully tiled and fitted with a walk-in double shower, WC, wash hand basin and extractor fan.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
